	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Type "@" and part of a Space's name to jump to it (for example @ino). Matching is fuzzy (ino finds innopts) and lists only the Spaces on the display your cursor is on, leaving out the one you are already on. The number of a Space also works.

Type "w" and a window command to snap the window you were in (for example w left, w top right, w max, w restore).

Needs the cubicle command: run "just install" in the Cubicle repo (links it to ~/.local/bin and installs the app).</string>
